# Loop: {{id}}

<!--
Purpose: the journal of one loop — one named wait for a state change. It holds the loop record handed to each sentinel round and one block per handoff.
Written by: the orchestrator (main session) only. The sentinel is read-only and never writes it.
Location: by default `.project/loops/<id>.md`, where `<id>` matches `^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]*$`; moved to `.project/loops/archive/` when the loop closes. The location the orchestrator resolved at loop creation applies in place of the default.
Version control: the journal is session state and is not committed by default; the orchestrator adds the loops directory to `.git/info/exclude` unless the project's declared VCS strategy says to commit journals.
-->

